<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Time Warner said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Time Warner said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter downgraded Time Warner Inc to neutral from buy, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 5/8 to 37-1/8.</p>
</text>
